# Guaranteed Sugar Price Period

This scope computes the fixed period during which guaranteed prices for cane sugar applied.

```catala
declaration scope SugarPricePeriod:
  output start_date content date
  output end_date content date
```

## Guaranteed Period Dates

The guaranteed prices applied for the period starting 1 July 1984 and ending 30 June 1985.

```catala
scope SugarPricePeriod:
  date round down
  definition start_date equals |1984-07-01|
  definition end_date equals |1985-06-30|
```